{"3260240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drivers of the Apocalypse", "steam_appid": 3260240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drivers of the Apocalypse</strong> is a high-octane action-driving combat game set in a vast, treacherous wasteland. You step into the shoes of Artemis, a junior mercenary working for Thunder Strike Force. Your mission? Stop deadly convoys, defeat powerful bosses, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/209fc85ab42387d2b6aa775d6becf5d2.poster.avif?t=1782918603\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/209fc85ab42387d2b6aa775d6becf5d2.webm?t=1782918603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art of Tactical Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is all about strategy and precision—steal weakened enemy vehicles, jump from car to car in mid-battle, and use each ride’s strengths to your advantage. If your vehicle gets destroyed, don’t worry. Simply leap to another and keep fighting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/aca07862387223ded6c56bbd6ecea525.poster.avif?t=1782918603\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/aca07862387223ded6c56bbd6ecea525.webm?t=1782918603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battles on wheels Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its fast-paced vehicle-swapping mechanic, <i>Drivers of the Apocalypse</i> offers a chaotic mix of driving and combat. The game features a series of epic boss encounters, challenging you to make quick decisions and master your driving skills as you take on the toughest road warriors in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/7bc29af2bd6efffa948093843ab64ad6.poster.avif?t=1782918603\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/7bc29af2bd6efffa948093843ab64ad6.webm?t=1782918603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Vehicle Combat:</strong> Switch between enemy vehicles on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Take down huge convoys and powerful leaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic World:</strong> Explore and conquer the wasteland, using cars as your ultimate weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drivers of the Apocalypse</strong> is a high-octane action-driving combat game set in a vast, treacherous wasteland. You step into the shoes of Artemis, a junior mercenary working for Thunder Strike Force. Your mission? Stop deadly convoys, defeat powerful bosses, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/209fc85ab42387d2b6aa775d6becf5d2.poster.avif?t=1782918603\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/209fc85ab42387d2b6aa775d6becf5d2.webm?t=1782918603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art of Tactical Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is all about strategy and precision—steal weakened enemy vehicles, jump from car to car in mid-battle, and use each ride’s strengths to your advantage. If your vehicle gets destroyed, don’t worry. Simply leap to another and keep fighting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/aca07862387223ded6c56bbd6ecea525.poster.avif?t=1782918603\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/aca07862387223ded6c56bbd6ecea525.webm?t=1782918603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battles on wheels Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its fast-paced vehicle-swapping mechanic, <i>Drivers of the Apocalypse</i> offers a chaotic mix of driving and combat. The game features a series of epic boss encounters, challenging you to make quick decisions and master your driving skills as you take on the toughest road warriors in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/7bc29af2bd6efffa948093843ab64ad6.poster.avif?t=1782918603\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/7bc29af2bd6efffa948093843ab64ad6.webm?t=1782918603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Vehicle Combat:</strong> Switch between enemy vehicles on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Take down huge convoys and powerful leaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic World:</strong> Explore and conquer the wasteland, using cars as your ultimate weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Steal enemy cars and battle through convoys in Drivers of the Apocalypse. Weaken vehicles with gunfire, then leap into new rides to keep the chaos going. Face off against multiple bosses in fast-paced, high-octane battles for survival in a brutal, post-apocalyptic wasteland.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Drivers of the Apocalypse is shaping up to be a love letter to both car combat fanatics and indie game purists.”<br>24indie<br><br>“Explorable wastelands and hectic firefights have shot it up near the top of our most wanted games list!”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/header.jpg?t=1782918603", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/ad244797847711a378d32182c977426e60d8064d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782918603", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/ad244797847711a378d32182c977426e60d8064d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782918603", "website": "https://driversoftheapocalypse.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and